r  photographed the crime scene a pair of  detectives paced around the apartment  trying to piece together what happened a  pair of armed well-trained officers  strangled with such force that their  necks snapped and across from them was a  pile of bloody bones meat and human skin  before the detectives had time to draw  any conclusions a group of black suited  fbi agents arrived and ordered the local  cops to vacate the area they were taking  over the investigation now don't worry  these weren't agents from the unusual  incidence unit here to bungle this case  further they were scp foundation field  agents undercover and actively searching  for a certain ornary bag of bones  scp-3114 a skeleton that the adjectives  spooky and scary don't even begin to  cover but first a question  wouldn't it be chilly to have no skin on  it's an old nursery rhyme that you might  have heard during your childhood and if  you ask our professional opinion here at  scp explained we'd say yes it would be  and  scp-3114 can confirm this from  first-hand experience that's why if ever  you run into it it may leave the  encounter wearing your skin  that's right  scp-3114 is a skeleton so desperate to  be just like us it's willing to skin any  human it meets and wear our bloody pelts  like a halloween costume this probably  leaves you with a very understandable  question so  what's his whole deal and thankfully we  have at least some of the answers to  that after conducting a series of  cognitive tests on the anomaly  foundation researchers concluded that  scp-3114 responds primarily to visual  stimuli with its other senses ranging  from muted to non-existent if something  even vaguely humanoid enters its line of  sight 3114 will enter its rage state  making a beeline for the victim and  strangling them to death researchers  believe 3114 chooses strangulation as  its favor murder method because it  leaves the skin intact aside from a few  minor bruises and abrasions and once the  victim is dead it will begin  meticulously cutting them open and  removing their bones again trying its  best to do as little damage to the skin  as possible  scp-3114 will then attempt to wear the  skin as its own eventually discarding it  after wear and tear sets in in one  interaction subject d 1724 an adult male  entered scp-3114  containment chamber  scp-3114 attacked him reacting with an  increased level of aggression when the  man tried to fight back  scp-3114 damaged the body of  d-1724 to the point that halfway through  removing his bones it decided that even  the skin was beyond salvaging it  discarded the body in the corner of its  enclosure placing sticks and boxes over  it in what researchers believed to be a  form of pseudo-burial tests on  scp-3114's physical makeup indicate that  it is stronger and more resilient than a  normal human skeleton owing to it being  made from a far denser material than  non-anomalous human bones during tests  researchers attacked the bones with  sledgehammers power tools and other  means of exterior impact concluding that  it took up to three times more force to  break one of the anomalies bones than  those of a normal person  scp-3114 also has regenerative healing  properties being able to mend broken  bones at shocking speeds making the  creature effectively immortal even  though  scp-3114 has no musculature or  connective tissue of any kind its  skeleton is still somehow to support  itself and move independently when a  bone is removed or pulled away from its  place it will quickly return to its  original position once a force is no  longer acting on it it also has far  greater speed and strength than your  average non-anomalous human despite its  lack of muscles  scp-3114 also seems to have some  semblance of intelligence as an  extension of its drive to appear more  human it even has periods of dormancy  where it mimics human sleep researchers  have placed multiple items in  scp-3114's enclosure to observe how it  reacts these items have included sticks  boxes tires and building blocks a few  experiments even involved placing live  subjects into its enclosure often with  predictably violent results due to the  danger of being in proximity of scp-3114  foundation researchers use projections  of humans to lure it into a smaller  secondary containment cell adjacent to  its primary enclosure foundation staff  are barred from entry until  scp-3114 has been locked in this  secondary cell only then can items be  added or removed from its habitat mess  this up and you're all but guaranteed a  closed casket funeral something this  strong and aggressive can create  considerable containment challenges for  the foundation so they started exploring  a new question what can pacify this  walking skeleton's homicidal wrath two  things as it turns out the first is  finding a skin that fits just right  researchers placed a freshly deceased  male cadaver into  scp-3114's enclosure naturally  scp-3114 began to systematically remove  the bones of the cadaver one by one then  place the skin of the corpse over its  own skeletal frame  scp-3114 seemed happy with its new skin  observing itself in a mirror scp-3114  studied the reflection from different  angles attempting to smile with its  sagging face and mimicking hand gestures  one might see in common social  situations intrigued by this development  researchers sent d-4843 into the chamber  to interact directly with scp-3114  upon coming face-to-face with  scp-3114 wearing decaying human skin the  human subject became terrified and  attempted to leave the enclosure  scp-3114 persisted in trying to interact  with the d-class attempting a handshake  and even caressing  d-4843's face its stolen skin sculpted  into an unflinching smile the d-class  was not charmed by this instead he wet  himself and was allowed to leave the  enclosure to change his underwear  scp-3114 seemed confused by the  subject's fear and subsequent departure  waiting by the door for him to come back  he then grew frustrated and looked at  itself in the mirror again this time  reacting angrily and violently tearing  off its skin perhaps made self-conscious  by the d-class's reaction to its new  face from that encounter researchers  concluded that  scp-3114 would not immediately attack if  it was wearing a skin that it deemed  suitable the second thing that calms  this bag of bones is the companionship  of man's best friend that's right  scp-3114  has a proclivity towards dogs this was  discovered in the series of experiments  where the foundation cross-tested the  anomaly with a variety of animal  specimens the first of these animals was  a gorilla scp-3114  appeared to exhibit some hesitation at  first indicating a level of recognition  between humans and our not so distant  evolutionary cousins but unfortunately  the confrontation ended violently when  the gorilla became agitated and tried to  exert its dominance over scp-3114  this led to a physical altercation where  the gorilla was overpowered and killed  though not without breaking one of  scp-3114's ribs first thankfully the  second attempt at animal interaction  this time with a border collie went much  smoother  scp-3114 took care to be gentle when  playing with and petting the dog and  even when the dog attempted to bite one  of its leg bones scp-3114  did not react in an exponentially  violent manner the pair spent the better  part of two hours playing together  playing fetch and seeming to enjoy each  other's company it's comforting to know  that there are at least some things  capable of temporarily taming this stack  of murderous calcium but what happens  when it breaches containment this brings  us back to our halloween crime scene an  embedded field agent in the fbi  introduced himself as special agent  thomas seaward he spoke to the local  detectives on the scene showing them a  badge they didn't recognize and asking  them to come downstairs to a mobile  office outside the building where they  would be debriefed members of mobile  task force gamma 5 also known as the red  herrings were waiting in this unit to  administer amnestics to any members of  local law enforcement who knew about the  case they would later also canvas the  building for other witnesses and make  arrangements to ensure that the body cam  footage of the two fallen officers would  be destroyed it was also unclear exactly  how scp-3114  escaped containment but recapturing the  subject for the safety of the local  population remained of paramount  importance with this goal in mind agent  sieward mobilized mtf pi one also known  as the city slickers a mobile task force  that specializes in the investigation  containment and subsequent cleanup of  anomalies in densely populated urban  environments under the guise of the fbi  the pai-1 members spread across the  streets of chicago in black vehicles  monitoring police scanners for reports  or sightings of walking skeletons  attacking the civilian population  meanwhile several blocks away scp-3114  found itself walking past a row of  clothing stores it stopped at the site  of a mannequin modeling sportswear and a  window display instead of charging at  the humanoid figure with lethal intent  scp-3114 calmly walked into the store  and approached the mannequin he began to  study the figure taking off its clothes  and trying them on piece by piece when  it was fully clothed it assumed the  mannequin's pose but then it began to  observe itself in a nearby mirror with  wrapped fascination a store clerk  emerged from the back room noticing that  someone was trying on clothes outside of  the changing room he walked over to  offer assistance but was stopped in his  tracks at the site of this strange new  customer and the turn of his bleached  white skull not long after that the  anomaly left the store wearing the  clerk's skin as it emerged onto the  streets unnoticed amidst the throng of  trick-or-treaters  scp-3114 took in its surroundings what a  strange new world it found itself in  then it spotted a nearby group of  trick-or-treaters wearing various  costumes most notably a plastic skull  mask  scp-31  had found its people excited by the  prospect of another walking skeleton  scp-3114 decided to follow the group as  they sauntered over to a larger crowd  gathering on the main avenue for the  annual halloween parade among the many  participants dressed as werewolves and  vampires and other classic halloween  creatures  scp-3114 noticed a group of creators  dressed as skeletons dancing and walking  together people were cheering them on  taking photos and smiling at the  spectacle perhaps it wasn't so bad to be  a bone man after all and everyone else  at the parade had their eyes on scp-3114  they didn't see it as a violent  anomalous skeleton wearing skins stolen  from an innocent store clerk they saw it  as one of the most brilliantly realistic  costumes the parade had ever seen people  stared and waved and smiled in awe and  scp-3114 was loving every bit of  attention soon enough  scp-3114 was leading the parade waving  gleefully at the crowds of impressed  trick-or-treaters it walked with the  others for several blocks occasionally  picking up fallen candy to throw at the  crowd wow great costume that looks super  real mister call the nearby  eight-year-old marveling up at scp-3114  do you want to come trick-or-treating  with us emotion to a group of three  costume friends they were all dressed as  members of the avengers  scp-3114 turned its bony head draped in  its stolen skin and followed the eager  kids as they began walking from house to  house asking for halloween treats  watching the children stick out their  bags and plastic pumpkins asking for  candy  scp-3114 began mimicking the behavior it  even picked up and started to carry its  own plastic pumpkin meanwhile across  town agent thomas seward was notified  about a pile of bloody bones found  behind the counter in an upmarket  clothing store only one creature in town  tonight could be behind that  scp-3114 seward made a call to all  available gamma-5 members requesting a  cleanup on-site and comprehensive and  monastic treatment for all witnesses at  the crime scene seward and his team hit  the bricks searching the surrounding  area he noticed the large crowds leaving  the parade with some adolescents  marveling at the amazing costume the  zombie looking guy was wearing and at  that moment it all came together for  agent seward what better place for a  monster wearing human skin to hide than  in plain sight on halloween he mused to  himself while unclipping his radio from  his jacket seward ordered all available  agents to converge on the main avenue  and search any trick-or-treaters wearing  any costume that looked like rotting  human skin they were on the clock if  they didn't get to  scp-3114 before its current skin suit  degraded fully it would claim another  life tonight meanwhile  scp-3114 itself continued its night out  in public trick-or-treating with a group  of children who were blissfully unaware  of how much danger they were in as they  went home to home the creature's costume  started to take on a pallid green  complexion as the rot set in it gave off  the most repulsive smell at some point  flies even began to gather around it to  any ignorant passerby it was still the  most horrifying and brilliant costume  they'd ever seen and whoever was wearing  it must have been so committed to the  character because they never said a word  as the night wore on the children each  got calls from their mothers telling  them it was time to come home after all  the obligatory grumbles they gave in and  did so wishing their strange silent  friend in the horrifying zombie costume  a happy halloween this left scp-3114  adrift wandering around not sure exactly  what to do with itself perhaps it was  time to find a new skin maybe then  people would want to hang out with it  again the anomaly was distracted from  its dangerous thoughts by a dog barking  on a nearby lawn  scp-3114 was delighted to find another  four-legged friend out here in the wild  and approach to pet the tiny creature as  it wagged its little tail how nice it  felt to finally have a familiar comfort  again that's when i noticed one more  little boy wandering the lonely streets  a new friend perhaps  scp-3114 would follow him and see just a  few blocks down scp agents scoured the  streets with flashlights asking anyone  they could if they'd seen someone  wearing an eerily realistic costume with  little in the way of success  agent seward was in the middle of  questioning a man who had participated  in the parade earlier that night when he  got a phone call from one of his  subordinates listening to police  scanners agents had intercepted a call  coming from a terrified mother who  claimed that a grown man in a strange  costume had followed her little boy home  the agents immediately made their way to  the address making sure local police  were notified not to respond to the call  upon arrival they found that scp-314  had broken into the family's living room  and was petting the family's dog the  skin suit had almost fully degraded now  hanging off the monster's body like  rotten bologna they didn't have much  time agent seward had his men surround  the building as a containment vehicle  backed up towards the home they couldn't  engage  scp-3114 directly without the risk of a  fatality that's why they'd fitted the  inside of the vehicle with a projector  just like the one inside scp-3114  sell to lure it back into the trap soon  enough just as seward and all the others  had predicted  scp-3114 began to angrily tear off the  rotten skin of the unfortunate store  clerk its bones shown in the moonlight  once more stained with blood the next  person that saw would be dead so it was  extremely lucky that the next person it  saw was the hologram of a male d-class  standing deep in the back of the  containment vehicle's portable cell  scp-3114 sped towards the hologram  grasping claws outstretched so intent on  getting its new skin that it didn't even  notice the bulkhead closing behind it  agent seward breathed a sigh of relief  as the vehicle drove off to the nearest  containment site but for him and the  rest of his men the night had just begun  they still had a hell of a mess to clean  up and all this just so that murderous  skeleton could have a happy halloween  now go check out  scp-060 infernal occult skeleton and  scp-1123 atrocity skull for more  nightmarish anomalous bones

